# Untracked/ignored paths copied into every new worktree.
#
# node_modules is ~22M / 1650 files — cheaper to copy than to install per worktree. The copy
# does not bring node_modules/.bin, though, whose entries are all symlinks, so no local binary
# is runnable until you run `npm install` once in the worktree. That takes under a second and
# needs no network: every package is already there and npm only relinks the bins.
#
# Don't add `notes` here. It's a symlink to the private drafts repo, and a per-worktree copy
# would fork the history of work in progress. See CLAUDE.md.
node_modules/
